{"type":"new","contents":"/-\nInfoGeometry/Algebraic/MatrixAutomorphyFactor.lean\n\nMatrix-valued automorphy factors for the higher-rank Cartan towers.\nNo complex imports.\n-/\n\nimport InfoGeometry.Algebraic.CartanCocycle\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry.Algebraic.Cartan\n\n/--\nA generic matrix/group-valued automorphy factor over a group action.\n\nThis is the higher-rank replacement for a scalar denominator `cτ + d`.\nThe target `A` may later be instantiated by a matrix group, a metaplectic\ncover, a compact Cartan factor, or a Clifford-unit subgroup.\n-/\nstructure MatrixAutomorphyFactor\n    (G X A : Type*)\n    [Group G] [MulAction G X] [Monoid A] where\n  toFun : G → X → A\n  map_one : ∀ x, toFun 1 x = 1\n  map_mul : ∀ g h x, toFun (g * h) x = toFun g (h • x) * toFun h x\n\ninstance\n    {G X A : Type*}\n    [Group G] [MulAction G X] [Monoid A] :\n    CoeFun (MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A) (fun _ => G → X → A) where\n  coe J := J.toFun\n\nnamespace MatrixAutomorphyFactor\n\nvariable\n    {G H X A R : Type*}\n    [Group G] [Group H]\n    [MulAction G X] [MulAction H X]\n    [Monoid A] [Monoid R]\n\n/--\nPull back a matrix automorphy factor along a group homomorphism.\n\nThe hypothesis `hsmul` says that the `G`-action is exactly the action induced\nfrom the `H`-action through `φ`.\n-/\ndef pullback\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor H X A)\n    (φ : G →* H)\n    (hact : ∀ (g : G) (x : X), φ g • x = g • x) :\n    MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A where\n  toFun g x := J (φ g) x\n  map_one x := by\n    simpa using J.map_one x\n  map_mul g h x := by\n    calc\n      J (φ (g * h)) x = J (φ g * φ h) x := by rw [φ.map_mul]\n      _ = J (φ g) ((φ h) • x) * J (φ h) x := J.map_mul (φ g) (φ h) x\n      _ = J (φ g) (h • x) * J (φ h) x := by\n            simp [hact h x]\n\n/-- Forget the matrix-specific name and view the factor as a Cartan automorphy factor. -/\ndef toCartanAutomorphyFactor\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A) :\n    CartanAutomorphyFactor G X A where\n  toFun := J\n  map_one := J.map_one\n  map_mul := J.map_mul\n\n@[simp]\ntheorem toCartanAutomorphyFactor_apply\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (g : G)\n    (x : X) :\n    J.toCartanAutomorphyFactor g x = J g x :=\n  rfl\n\n/--\nOn any subgroup fixing a point, a matrix automorphy factor is an ordinary\n`MonoidHom`.\n-/\ndef stabilizerHom\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (x : X)\n    (K : Subgroup G)\n    (hK : ∀ g ∈ K, g • x = x) :\n    K →* A :=\n  J.toCartanAutomorphyFactor.stabilizerHom x K hK\n\n@[simp]\ntheorem stabilizerHom_apply\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (x : X)\n    (K : Subgroup G)\n    (hK : ∀ g ∈ K, g • x = x)\n    (γ : K) :\n    J.stabilizerHom x K hK γ = J (γ : G) x :=\n  rfl\n\n/-- Multiplicativity of the stabilizer readout, delegated to Mathlib `MonoidHom`. -/\ntheorem stabilizerHom_map_mul\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (x : X)\n    (K : Subgroup G)\n    (hK : ∀ g ∈ K, g • x = x)\n    (γ δ : K) :\n    J.stabilizerHom x K hK (γ * δ) =\n      J.stabilizerHom x K hK γ * J.stabilizerHom x K hK δ :=\n  (J.stabilizerHom x K hK).map_mul γ δ\n\n/--\nConvert a matrix automorphy factor into a rotor cocycle through a monoid\nhomomorphism.\n-/\ndef toRotorCocycle\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (weightReadout : A →* R) :\n    CartanRotorCocycle G X R :=\n  CartanRotorCocycle.toRotorCocycle J.toCartanAutomorphyFactor weightReadout\n\n@[simp]\ntheorem toRotorCocycle_apply\n    (J : MatrixAutomorphyFactor G X A)\n    (weightReadout : A →* R)\n    (g : G)\n    (x : X) :\n    J.toRotorCocycle weightReadout g x = weightReadout (J g x) :=\n  rfl\n\nend MatrixAutomorphyFactor\n\nend InfoGeometry.Algebraic.Cartan\n","mtime":1778320661490}